# The gateway's silo routes (apps/GeoAssets.Gateway, Destinations:GeoAssets:Silos): one line per company silo,
# tenant domain -> the silo's container on geoassets_default. A request whose X-Tenant-Domain header names a listed domain
# goes to that silo; any other request (no header, or an unlisted domain) goes to the shared kernel, never to a silo.
# Copy to deploy/distributor-silo/gateway-silos.env (git-ignored) and recreate the gateway with gateway.override.yaml
# (README.md "Route the gateway to the silo").
Destinations__GeoAssets__Silos__coelba.local=http://geoasset-server-coelba:8080
# Destinations__GeoAssets__Silos__cemar.local=http://geoasset-server-cemar:8080
# Destinations__GeoAssets__Silos__cepisa.local=http://geoasset-server-cepisa:8080
